{"id":"660522","name":"红火虾仁","author":"美食家A0936","authorId":"13174873","desc":"","cover":"images/660522/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"西芹","amount":"200g"},{"name":"红菜椒","amount":"150g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾仁清洗干净。","img":"images/660522/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西芹适量。","img":"images/660522/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红菜椒一个。","img":"images/660522/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"新鲜虾洗净后，去头去虾线。","img":"images/660522/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用刀从中间切开。","img":"images/660522/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧水，水开后放油，把处理好的虾仁煮开。","img":"images/660522/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"虾仁卷起后即可捞出备用。","img":"images/660522/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"红菜椒改刀处理好备用。","img":"images/660522/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"西芹改刀处理好备用。","img":"images/660522/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"处理好以后装盘备用。","img":"images/660522/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"姜蒜处理好备用。","img":"images/660522/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"被少许水淀粉。","img":"images/660522/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/660522/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"油热后爆香姜、蒜。","img":"images/660522/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入配菜。","img":"images/660522/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"翻炒均匀至断生。","img":"images/660522/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加入适量生抽。","img":"images/660522/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"我加入适量蚝油。","img":"images/660522/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"倒入处理好的虾仁，并翻炒均匀。","img":"images/660522/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"加入水淀粉。","img":"images/660522/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"加入适量芝麻油。","img":"images/660522/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"翻炒均匀至挂浆后，即可起锅。","img":"images/660522/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"配菜提前处理好，芹菜不用切这么长。这一次配菜有点多，可以适当减少。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}